### 4. Flow Diagrams

**Location**: `docs/flows/`

**When to Update**:

* When implementing a new user flow
* When modifying an existing flow
* When adding new screens or steps

**Requirements**:

* **Must draw end-to-end flow diagrams** for each feature
* Visualize the complete user journey from start to finish
* Include all screens, API calls, and decision points
* Use standard flowchart symbols or sequence diagrams
* Can use Mermaid diagrams, PlantUML, or SVG graphics

**Example Mermaid Diagram**:

```markdown
## Authentication Flow

\`\`\`mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant Database
    
    User->>UI: Enter email
    UI->>API: POST /otp (email)
    API->>Database: Check user exists
    Database-->>API: User found
    API-->>UI: OTP sent
    UI-->>User: Show verification screen
    
    User->>UI: Enter OTP
    UI->>API: POST /otp/validate
    API->>Database: Validate OTP
    Database-->>API: Valid
    API-->>UI: JWT tokens
    UI-->>User: Redirect to home
\`\`\`
```

